# ROVEXO GLOBAL FAIL CLOSED ENGINE v1.0 (LOCK)

**If something fails, the user must believe information is temporarily unavailable — never that the platform is broken.**

## Never

White screen · crash · broken navigation/UI/buttons/routes · expose secrets · ENV names · API names · DB names · admin clients · stack traces · internal errors.

## Always

Header · back · navigation · home · skeletons · Retry · responsive layout · design system.

## Owner copy only

Use `FailClosedPanel` / `toUserSafeFailClosedMessage()` from `@/lib/fail-closed` or `@/lib/master-engine`.

Never render `error.message` in UI.

## Wrong

```tsx
<p>{error.message}</p>
```

## Correct

```tsx
<FailClosedPanel onRetry={reset} />
```
